;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>A sharply colder air came at us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜岡駅夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The place we got off was an unstaffed station called <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="さくらおか">Sakuraoka</STYLE>, with nothing at all around it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If there is a culprit <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="かた">posing</STYLE> as the shinigami, then the harder a place is for people to reach, the better. [TN: shinigami: a god of death]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When the train stopped at this station, I decided we would get off here.<PG>
Nobody but us knows that we have come here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was nobody else who got off at this station.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜岡山.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It had gone completely dark around us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
True to the name Sakuraoka, the whole mountain was covered with cherry trees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No wind, no cars, no sign of anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was only 'a presence with no presence,' and the moonlight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The name of the station was unfamiliar, and I had no real idea whereabouts we were.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜岡ベンチ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I took <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> by the hand, and sat down on a half-rotted bench.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We had not exchanged a word since then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> neither cried nor showed any sign of being <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="おび">frighten</STYLE>ed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She only kept her mouth tightly shut and watched the world darken outside the train window.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> was looking this way and that for something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
And then, she let go of my hand and walked off under one of the few streetlights.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
Before long <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> came walking back to me with something in her hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What she was holding in that hand was...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花木刀片手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "T" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n600\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n-500\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n600\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n-500\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Hold on! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> came closer holding a long, solid tree branch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... it isn't true...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had I been <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="だま">deceiv</STYLE>ed after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had it been a friendship that was never real?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or else―<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"This should be some use at least... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If the shinigami won't listen to what I say... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I will protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> with this!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> sat down on the bench and gripped the branch hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was heavy, and it looked hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had jumped to a conclusion, and it seems that somewhere in my heart I still hold a fear of <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Whatever comes... I will protect you, absolutely!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> gripped the tree branch tight again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I could hear the buzz of <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>'s smartphone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"It's </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She showed a flicker of hesitation about whether to answer.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes... hell―"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hello, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">!? Where on earth are you!? And I can't get through to </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> either!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE>'s loud voice carried over to me as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Deep in the mountains as we were, the signal seemed to be reaching us.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... I'm with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> right now. Somewhere called Sakuraoka Station, I don't really know where. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is... fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, it's me, Natsumi. Right now it's just the two of us, me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Thank goodness..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And then, <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> switched it to speaker mode.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, please tell me anything. I am absolutely on </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s side."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"All right... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> I can trust."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Thank you very much."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"So, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> wants to ask something, right? What should I tell you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"First, how much does </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I told her everything. That the one who killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Natsumi's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And that I'm the culprit of the Megasawa City murders, who has cursed six people to death so far. If you're with the </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">police</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you know already, don't you?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yes, I know... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But I simply cannot think that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> is the culprit. Because when I think it over, all sorts of things are strange...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> says that as well... Well, fine, leave it at that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But I'd like to hear why you think so."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> believes that before returning to Motoki-cho she cursed people to death three times―six people in all, doesn't she?</STYLE> <STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> believe you are the culprit of the Megasawa City murders."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's right, so?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> had a perfect alibi at the time, and so did </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. All three times, what is more. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">So the police only asked you a few questions and that was the end of it, and you never even became a candidate for suspect."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"And so what...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> has the power to curse, and can kill people by a method that will not get her arrested. That is what you are certain of, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You're getting on my nerves...! What are you trying to say!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was a pause for a while, and then <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> began to speak slowly, in a calm voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"From here on this is nothing but my own guesswork, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">if it happens to be right..."</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Come on!</STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">　Just say it!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Please run away, right now."</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "83" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? Run?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　We've come this deep into the mountains already... why do we need to run any further...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"This is not only </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, it is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> too! Both of you, get away from there right now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> alone I could understand, but me too...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Haha... What are you talking about, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. Am I going to be cursed to death by my dad as well?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> was shaking, and still laughing through her nose.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"The Megasawa City murders that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> says she caused with a curse... that is a real, proper murder case!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"All right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, that's enough. I'm hanging up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! Please do as I say!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Don't be stupid! Why would my dad come after me as well!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, wind blew through a place that had had no wind at all.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\fear1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000,人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\能面フラッシュ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜岡ベンチ赤.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">"A-Aaah...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What is it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Danger...! This place is extremely dangerous...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My instinct was sounding the alarm more fiercely than ever before...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! Is this that intuition of yours!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Mister</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, it's Sakuraoka Station! Floor it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">"R-Right...!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\著作権フリー 商用利用可能 な 【効果音】パトカー　サイレン　警察　パトロール　ピーポー　２.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the other end of the line came a <STYLE ID="12">man</STYLE>'s voice and the siren of a patrol car.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, it's dangerous here! Let's run, quickly!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
I pulled <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> by the hand and stood up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ベンチ殴る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000,人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "50" "50" "500" "30"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
An instant later came the sound of the bench we had been sitting on being struck with a blunt weapon and splitting.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "escape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "50"}
